{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Ga1ahad and Scientific Witchery","artist":"Mili","date":"2026-08-01","sourceId":"14489268:003","sourceHash":"64f9eb6113ca2177ae5fc58e3a8a36210cddbd6598d98f030d1e75f26001a67f","duration":224.05000000000018,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":22.058629,"end":24.737923,"text":"The magical potion of reanimation","translation":"되살림의 마법 물약","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":24.757923,"end":27.727141,"text":"Bittersweet cranberry flavoured euphoria","translation":"새콤달콤 크랜베리 맛 황홀감","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":27.747141,"end":30.637109,"text":"Rise from bed my darling","translation":"침대에서 일어나 내 사랑","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":30.69637,"end":32.105997,"text":"So I can see you again","translation":"널 다시 볼 수 있게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.125997,"end":33.57098,"text":"So I can kill you again","translation":"널 다시 죽일 수 있게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":33.60561,"end":35.735048,"text":"My brains accelerate","translation":"내 머리가 빠르게 돌아가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":35.755048,"end":36.658163,"text":"And I'll","translation":"그리고 난","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":36.694802,"end":40.84913,"text":"Reassemble you again","translation":"널 다시 조립할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":45.132596,"end":49.196613,"text":"The witches can't be loved","translation":"마녀들은 사랑받을 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":49.261517,"end":51.895,"text":"So bravely I fought","translation":"그래서 난 용감히 싸웠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":52.010798,"end":55.049998,"text":"They fell and failed","translation":"그들은 쓰러져 실패했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":55.069998,"end":56.785916,"text":"My Lady doesn't wilt","translation":"나의 레이디는 시들지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":56.829538,"end":59.565,"text":"Lata lulila lulula lilula ta","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":59.738777,"end":62.448122,"text":"Lata lulila lulula lulalila","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":62.488059,"end":65.415,"text":"Lata lulila lulula lilula ta","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":65.65723,"end":68.326527,"text":"Lata lulila lulula lulalila","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":68.346527,"end":73.975,"text":"Poisoned sandwich tea party starts now","translation":"독 든 샌드위치 티파티가 지금 시작돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":74.165006,"end":75.025,"text":"Eat up","translation":"어서 먹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":75.29471,"end":77.010629,"text":"If you're lucky you won't rot","translation":"운이 좋으면 썩지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":77.074245,"end":77.935,"text":"Eat up","translation":"어서 먹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":78.293926,"end":79.243673,"text":"It's your turn","translation":"네 차례야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":79.263673,"end":80.213419,"text":"Eat till you drop","translation":"쓰러질 때까지 먹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":80.233419,"end":81.136534,"text":"Eat up","translation":"어서 먹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":81.193168,"end":82.882721,"text":"Maybe this time you'll be caught","translation":"이번엔 잡힐지도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":82.902721,"end":83.896148,"text":"Eat up","translation":"어서 먹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":83.922455,"end":85.818996,"text":"Fill your stomach till it pops","translation":"배가 터질 때까지 채워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":85.871945,"end":86.865371,"text":"Eat up","translation":"어서 먹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":86.981655,"end":89.14913,"text":"Eat it all just eat it all","translation":"다 먹어 그냥 전부 먹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":89.211072,"end":92.155,"text":"Cause there's no poison after all","translation":"결국 독은 하나도 없으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":94.469697,"end":100.275,"text":"I've cleared mountains and dungeons","translation":"산과 던전을 모두 정복했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":100.408145,"end":104.067183,"text":"Iron maiden","translation":"철의 처녀","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":104.087183,"end":108.116124,"text":"My Lady has spoken","translation":"나의 레이디가 말씀하셨어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":108.136124,"end":111.565,"text":"\"Ga1ahad, you will shall never collapse\"","translation":"Ga1ahad 넌 결코 무너지지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":111.675199,"end":117.455134,"text":"So I charged up my lasers","translation":"그래서 내 레이저를 충전했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":117.493678,"end":119.751465,"text":"Talila lulila","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":119.783079,"end":122.672319,"text":"That makes your bones stronger than steel","translation":"그건 네 뼈를 강철보다 단단하게 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":122.692319,"end":124.751775,"text":"Tulila talila","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":124.771775,"end":127.661742,"text":"That backs up your thoughts to the cloud","translation":"그건 네 생각을 클라우드에 백업해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":127.701009,"end":128.784747,"text":"Truth or false","translation":"진실인가 거짓인가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":128.840711,"end":130.640236,"text":"It's the logic that dictates it all","translation":"모든 걸 지배하는 건 논리야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":130.660236,"end":132.285842,"text":"Rising edge ticks the clock","translation":"상승 신호가 시계를 움직여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":132.339797,"end":133.694469,"text":"Stimulates you flip-flop","translation":"널 자극해 플립플롭","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":133.739431,"end":134.615,"text":"Generate","translation":"생성해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":134.709177,"end":135.251046,"text":"Oscillate","translation":"진동해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":135.398997,"end":136.728644,"text":"Let your blood fill the gates","translation":"네 피가 게이트를 채우게 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":136.748644,"end":137.471136,"text":"Multiplex","translation":"다중화해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":137.498448,"end":139.033743,"text":"Process registration","translation":"등록을 처리해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":139.068037,"end":141.127494,"text":"Wipe off your pus","translation":"네 고름을 닦아내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":141.147494,"end":142.775,"text":"Grind down your vitamins","translation":"네 비타민을 갈아버려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":143.007008,"end":144.96649,"text":"The end justifies the means","translation":"목적은 수단을 정당화해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":144.98649,"end":146.431474,"text":"Open the book","translation":"책을 펴","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":146.476101,"end":153.835,"text":"Turn to page 617 — Scientific Witchery","translation":"617쪽 과학적 마녀술을 펼쳐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":162.39194,"end":163.111746,"text":"Someday","translation":"언젠가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":163.131746,"end":164.635,"text":"I'll conquer the land have you slayed","translation":"땅을 정복하고 널 죽이겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":164.891286,"end":165.70409,"text":"Blast away","translation":"날려버려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":165.831041,"end":166.27092,"text":"Blast away","translation":"날려버려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":166.29092,"end":166.832789,"text":"Don't be like Lancel0t","translation":"Lancel0t처럼 되지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":166.890763,"end":167.522944,"text":"You are the new upgrade","translation":"넌 새로운 업그레이드야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":167.550591,"end":168.995575,"text":"I appriciate your thoughts","translation":"네 생각은 고맙게 여겨","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":169.040202,"end":171.478611,"text":"But you've given me too much to tolerate","translation":"하지만 네가 내게 안긴 건 감당하기엔 너무 많아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":171.499559,"end":172.369326,"text":"I've done so much for you","translation":"널 위해 정말 많은 걸 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":172.389326,"end":174.014933,"text":"But you treat me this way","translation":"그런데 넌 날 이렇게 대해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":174.058889,"end":177.219791,"text":"No forgiveness for this endless love","translation":"이 끝없는 사랑은 용서 못 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":177.278048,"end":179.987334,"text":"My goddess never looked at me","translation":"나의 여신은 날 보지 않았어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":180.007334,"end":183.076527,"text":"Finally our wounds closed","translation":"마침내 우리 상처는 아물었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":183.096527,"end":185.264002,"text":"Our wounds closed","translation":"우리 상처는 아물었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":185.295952,"end":187.01187,"text":"Turned into","translation":"변해 버렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":187.045494,"end":189.655,"text":"Purple scabs","translation":"보랏빛 딱지로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":189.804773,"end":202.355,"text":"Kiss me tenderly gently violently","translation":"부드럽게 다정하게 격렬하게 내게 입 맞춰","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":202.841365,"end":207.086004,"text":"There's no undo and there's no repeat","translation":"되돌림도 반복도 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":207.230217,"end":211.565168,"text":"Can't go back to how we used to be","translation":"예전의 우리로 돌아갈 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":211.699049,"end":215.853377,"text":"There's no restart but only proceed","translation":"재시작은 없고 나아갈 뿐이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":215.917946,"end":219.685,"text":"Take up from where we've left off and see","translation":"멈춘 곳에서 다시 이어가 봐","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}